Subject: [PATCH] CAM AI: New program starts with no material chosen (no
 cooling warning for defaults nobody chose), the part-type hint sits under
 Part type, its warnings in the dialog's size, and a disabled Create says it
 waits for the part type (finding H1-18)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YVyxNm2Fwb8M6A8TiczcwA
